{"id":279097162,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTcxNjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/discussion","name":"discussion","color":"ccaaff","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","number":22,"title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_url":"https://github.com/Sauermann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":3,"created_at":"2024-12-20T13:11:35Z","updated_at":"2025-03-19T11:40:46Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T11:37:52Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100652","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100652","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100652.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100652.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-19T11:37:52Z"},"body":"**TL;DR: this is a non-breaking change that simplifies AudioStreamWAV a lot while improving the resampling quality.**\r\n\r\nA continuation and updated version of #83483, so everything that has been discussed there applies here. The original author, @wareya, has been added as the commit author, and I left myself as a co-author, as what I've done was mostly patching.\r\n\r\nRemoves the resampling code entirely from `AudioStreamPlaybackWAV` and makes it inherit from `AudioStreamPlaybackResampled`, fixes #58216. This brings the class in par with the Ogg Vorbis and MP3 equivalents, which already inherit from `Resampled`.\r\n\r\nI have tested this with as many audio files I could, with every loop mode, and found no problems.\r\n\r\nAny existing project needs no modifications to work with this PR. It barely modifies unexposed methods, so *no compatibility breaks*.\r\n\r\nA few notable changes:\r\n- IMA ADPCM audio now gets interpolated.\r\n- `do_resample` did two things: convert samples from their format to `AudioFrame`, then apply linear interpolation. Interpolation code was removed and the function renamed to `decode_samples`.\r\n- `DATA_PAD` has been removed from `AudioStreamWAV` as it lost its purpose. Functions that required handling the pads have been simplified, potentially reducing memory overhead.\r\n- QOA caches were also removed, as they were a workaround workaround to make resampling work fine in the previous implementation. Unnecessary in this one.\r\n- Linux release template builds using `production=yes` had a 4KB reduction in binary size. Note however that `AudioStreamPlaybackResampled` have an internal buffer of 1056B.\r\n\r\n## Caveats\r\n\r\nFiles imported with loop mode set to Forward, Ping-Pong or Backward in a build before #96768 was merged will cause crashes, as it will try to read one index out of bounds. It can be fixed by simply reimporting.","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100652/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100652/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}